# 🚀 AutoMind AI Enterprise Platform

## Autonomous Multi-Agent AI SaaS Platform

AutoMind AI is a production-grade enterprise AI automation platform that combines:

- Multi-Agent AI Systems
- Workflow Automation
- RAG Document Intelligence
- Persistent AI Memory
- Autonomous AI Agents
- Real-Time Analytics
- Enterprise Monitoring
- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
- SaaS Dashboard Architecture

This platform simulates real enterprise AI operations and autonomous workflow orchestration.

---

