# 🚀 Installation

## 1️⃣ Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/AutoMind-AI-Enterprise-Platform.git
```

---

## 2️⃣ Navigate Into Project

```bash
cd AutoMind-AI-Enterprise-Platform
```

---

## 3️⃣ Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## 4️⃣ Run Application

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

